From: 77450danik <ddziuba1@stu.vistula.edu.pl>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] desk: The size of the desktop's icons on the Settings page.

Small, Medium or Large: 32, 48 or 64 pixels at 100 %, the desktop's View
menu's sizes, at the system's scale. Applied, it is kept where Windows
keeps it and the desktop takes it at once (WM_SETTINGCHANGE
"DesktopIconSize").
